  DTS:Description="Ingest carrier scan event files (comma-delimited, ISO-8601 timestamps with a carrier-local offset, a sidecar .ctl file holding the expected row count). Scan status codes are carrier-specific and are landed untranslated; the translation happens downstream against raw.OracleCustomerMaster code sets. Duplicate scans within a file are counted, not rejected."
